WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,080
Then explore the Changbai Mountain completely and have a Jedi dream before leaving.

2
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:08,250
How is this speed possible?

3
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:10,530
Zhang Tong's physical skills are actually so strong

4
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:13,610
I completely underestimated Mr. Fan before.

5
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:15,010
did you see that dog

6
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:16,250
Jump ten meters away

7
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:17,970
It’s the prairie cheetah and the Mongolian tiger

8
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:19,570
It's impossible to run so fast, right?

9
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:21,010
What kind of dog is this?

10
00:00:21,370 --> 00:00:24,130
How did he train it? Don't discuss it in a daze.

11
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:25,410
time is very tight

12
00:00:25,770 --> 00:00:27,130
You also immediately go into the mountains to search

13
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:28,610
It's enough to leave one person to protect me

14
00:00:28,730 --> 00:00:30,610
There are thorns growing everywhere deep in the crater.

15
00:00:31,090 --> 00:00:34,210
But as expected, they are all the footprints left by our predecessors

16
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:35,890
There is no airtight wall in the world

17
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:37,570
The more dangerous the place, the more people will invade it.

18
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:38,770
Covering the entire basin

19
00:00:38,970 --> 00:00:40,450
There are only a few deep seedlings of ten years old

20
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:42,690
The century-old god doesn’t even have a hair on his head

21
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:43,690
Losing money in management

22
00:00:43,810 --> 00:00:46,170
The rest of the Jedi must have been raided by the Tramplers long ago.

23
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:47,850
Fan Qingxiang is destined to be disappointed this time

24
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:50,010
But if I just go back to the camp empty-handed now,

25
00:00:50,050 --> 00:00:51,010
It inevitably seems perfunctory

26
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:52,290
It's better to go to Baoxing to have a chance.
